start

:Open the "Promote" window;
:Click "Mappings";
:Click "Crystal Report Mappings";

:List of Crystal reports is displayed;
:Select required Crystal Report;
:Click "Edit Crystal Report Properties";

:"Edit Crystal Report Properties" tab appears;
note right
Displays list of properties 
and their values
end note

:Modify appropriate fields;
:Click "Apply";

if (Edited in source system?) then (yes)
  :"edited" is displayed;
endif

if (Created using Universes?) then (yes)
  :Cannot be mapped;
  :Use "Connections Mappings";
  stop
else
  :Proceed with mapping;
endif

switch (Mapping scope)
case (Single)
  :Map single report;
case (Group)
  :Map the group;
case (Multiple)
  :Not allowed;
  stop
endswitch

:Click "Save" or "Promote";

stop
